components used to represent in the component diagram:

component:
a rectangle with two tabs on the left side represents a component or a module 
interface:
it is a rectangle with two compartments in which the first component is labelled with interface tag and the other component has the operations or services that interface offers with out any any implementation or futhur details
provided interface :
an interface is represented with a circle connected to the component
required interface:
a semicircle which represents a service that is needed by one component from the the other component
dependency : 
it is represented with dashed arrow symbol 
connection or communication: 
two components connection represented with a solid line
